WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.269 --> 00:00:07.640
Another thing Dr. Bright is not allowed to
do: No showing bad movies to SCP-682!

00:00:07.640 --> 00:00:14.010
SCP-682 is famous for a lot of things: its
indestructible nature, its insatiable appetite

00:00:14.010 --> 00:00:18.500
for violence, and the overflowing well of
hate in its heart.

00:00:18.500 --> 00:00:23.950
Unsatisfied with SCP-682's ordinary level
of rage, Dr. Bright decided to take it upon

00:00:23.950 --> 00:00:29.250
himself to give the lizard even more things
to be angry about, and organized an informal

00:00:29.250 --> 00:00:34.450
"so bad it's good" film festival for the anomaly
and himself.

00:00:34.450 --> 00:00:39.720
The resulting damage, and loss of life, cost
the Foundation thousands of dollars.

00:00:39.720 --> 00:00:45.960
Movies on the "do not show to 682 list" include:
The work of Uwe Boll, the work of Neil Breen,

00:00:45.960 --> 00:00:51.640
The Room, Troll 2, Manos: The Hands of Fate,
and, let's face it, any other movie Dr. Bright

00:00:51.640 --> 00:00:52.680
can think of.

00:00:52.680 --> 00:00:55.680
No more movies.

